IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `P1-annex-iii`

-- P1-tests-annex-iii: tests for Annex III. Expected values are written from the text of Annex III (the line numbers in the comments are lines of the
-- consolidated text), as one truth rule per point, independently of the L4: every combination of the facts a point reads is asserted (a function
-- with more than five facts: the all-false case, each fact alone, all true, and the rows that matter). An argument order mixed up in the L4 would show here.
-- Arguments are listed in the order of the function's GIVEN.


§ `Annex III: point 1(a) listed`
-- text 1723-1724: remote biometric identification systems; not biometric verification whose sole purpose is to confirm identity
#ASSERT NOT (`Annex III point 1(a) the AI system is listed` FALSE FALSE FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT (`Annex III point 1(a) the AI system is listed` FALSE FALSE TRUE)
#ASSERT NOT (`Annex III point 1(a) the AI system is listed` FALSE TRUE FALSE)
