§ `Scenarios in the words of the Annex`

-- A CV-screening tool: intended to analyse and filter job applications (point 4(a), whose "in particular" names examples and closes nothing).
#ASSERT `Annex III point 4(a) the AI system is listed` TRUE
-- A credit-scoring tool that only detects financial fraud is excepted (point 5(b)); the same tool used to establish a credit score is listed.
#ASSERT NOT (`Annex III point 5(b) the AI system is listed` TRUE TRUE)
#ASSERT `Annex III point 5(b) the AI system is listed` TRUE FALSE
-- Biometric verification whose sole purpose is to confirm that a person is who they claim to be is not a remote biometric identification system listed in point 1(a).
#ASSERT NOT (`Annex III point 1(a) the AI system is listed` TRUE TRUE TRUE)
-- A biometric area whose use is not permitted under Union or national law is not listed (the chapeau of point 1, "in so far as").
#ASSERT NOT (`Annex III point 1 the AI system is listed in the area` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE)
#ASSERT `Annex III point 1 the AI system is listed in the area` TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE

